Then this:

[http://github.com/prx0r/patala/commit/e44eeaf9f22d7b8179a2310c4e3445954e90f65b](http://github.com/prx0r/patala/commit/e44eeaf9f22d7b8179a2310c4e3445954e90f65b)

was more important than it looked. It exposed:

```text
GET /api/resources
```

over `data/atlas/resources.ts`, with filters for type, tradition, access, essential status, etc.

And this:

[http://github.com/prx0r/patala/commit/87fff7e7ee8b4a881641cd0fc320046f715b2091](http://github.com/prx0r/patala/commit/87fff7e7ee8b4a881641cd0fc320046f715b2091)

