with typed `GroundingLink`s, exact resolution and immutable proof history.

See:

[http://github.com/prx0r/patala/commit/09a286a2a9c00267e07c4dbf73e77ad8174a9e18](http://github.com/prx0r/patala/commit/09a286a2a9c00267e07c4dbf73e77ad8174a9e18)

