# 6. Muktabodha — probably our #1 Tantra institutional partner

[http://muktabodha.org/digital-library/](http://muktabodha.org/digital-library/)

Current library:

[http://muktabodha-digital-library.org/](http://muktabodha-digital-library.org/)

Legacy IFP/Vedic collection:

[http://muktalib7.com/DL_CATALOG_ROOT/digital_library](http://muktalib7.com/DL_CATALOG_ROOT/digital_library)

